做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/db0de80d3a7223b3e81e.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n78118-1-8-2","ko":"채팅으로 친구들이랑 수다를 떨어요.","zh":"我会通过聊天和朋友们闲聊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"채팅으로","meaning":"网上聊天","explanation":"채팅：网上聊天；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"채팅","audio":"/audio/8717c4a8b887ab1d430c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"78118","senseId":"1","lemma":"채팅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"채팅으로","audio":"/audio/7b2487cc43a7e4632978.mp3"}},{"text":"친구들이랑","meaning":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","explanation":"친구：朋友，好友， 友人，故旧；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；이랑：连接共同参与或比较的对象，常表示“和、与”；结合句中动作理解。","readings":[{"term":"친구","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29742","senseId":"1","lemma":"친구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"친구들이랑","audio":"/audio/6a4db7b9fcaec26aa7de.mp3"}},{"text":"수다를","meaning":"废话，啰嗦，唠叨","explanation":"수다：废话，啰嗦，唠叨；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"수다","audio":"/audio/b63e8e52db2c00301bcb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64548","senseId":"1","lemma":"수다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수다를","audio":"/audio/683f668f4e74eb8fcc90.mp3"}},{"text":"떨어요.","meaning":"耍","explanation":"떨다：耍；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"떨다","audio":"/audio/c05578fd2da67674b9a9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65529","senseId":"6","lemma":"떨다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"떨어요","audio":"/audio/c981fc98856de39a5dd2.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"8717c4a8b887ab1d","term":"채팅","zh":"网上聊天","audio":"/audio/8717c4a8b887ab1d430c.mp3","entryId":"78118","definition":"多个使用者通过网络对着屏幕画面进行实时对话。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"1202aff936337891","term":"친구","zh":"朋友，好友， 友人，故旧","audio":"/audio/1202aff936337891e079.mp3","entryId":"29742","definition":"关系亲近而交往甚密的人。","pronunciation":["친구"]},{"id":"b63e8e52db2c0030","term":"수다","zh":"废话，啰嗦，唠叨","audio":"/audio/b63e8e52db2c00301bcb.mp3","entryId":"64548","definition":"无用的话很多；或指那样的言语。","pronunciation":["수ː다"]},{"id":"c05578fd2da67674","term":"떨다","zh":"耍","audio":"/audio/c05578fd2da67674b9a9.mp3","entryId":"65529","definition":"总是轻浮而不小心地做某种行动。","pronunciation":["떨ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/b672577c293af9e4de29.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.37,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=78118","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":123,"sequenceScore":2.0953,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我会通过聊天和朋友们闲聊。","您主要在互联网上做什么？","昨天是休息日，你做了什么？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["您主要在互联网上做什么？","昨天是休息日，你做了什么？","我会通过聊天和朋友们闲聊。"],"answer":2}]}
